  "name": "Iron Reno Stance",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You gain [Cancel: [(INT Mod) + (SR &times; 5) ]. This [Cancel] can only be removed by ending this skill. In addition, you take a -1D penalty to [Dodge Check].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that allows you to abandon evasion and take a stance to receive the enemy's attack. By releasing the impact from your feet into the earth, your body becomes an iron wall like an immovable rhinoceros.</p>",
